description:
Develop a circuit that converts a 4-bit binary input into a 4-bit Gray code output. The most significant bit of the Gray code is directly taken from the binary input, while each subsequent bit is generated by performing an exclusive OR operation between consecutive bits of the binary input. This module effectively facilitates binary to Gray code conversion, commonly used in digital systems to minimize errors during transitions.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] binary_in,
    output [3:0] gray_out
);

